{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-values satisfying the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d13fbdf429e001c582387dc599f1468f4e64d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|\\frac{5-x}{3}\\right| &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"93\" height=\"45\" />. [The symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42e32ea9361c740cbb968ee21d15749691f747c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/9029bad227e01fff796f99ec7bc182acbe4ea203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab0d6b0f629cdfba5b6ce68695ff0c5a2d6fd8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a$\" width=\"23\" height=\"8\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is negative, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is zero. The notation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/549468508d4685d380485596611540cb71017c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; a &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> can have any value between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.]\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e8426cb365b83b2c6d695d640d5b58e2f3d143f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 &lt; x &lt; 11\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -1 &lt; x &lt; 11\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x &lt; 11\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x &gt; 11\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ |x| &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"660\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Break up the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a> into two cases.\n</p><p>For the first case, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/255863f9f620ab023863b28b7c0712b6ad078959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e177f73af66bb8506ba952819ab62d1fa7d4a266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5-x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> is positive.  That means (for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae5293ff428505994083bea7564c5e7738d3d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d2beb3c23e652f285ba72a5499ab1c8c998419d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{5-x}{3} &lt; 2\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/516894789cf99457d1b8363ba1f73d65c44b32ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5-x&lt;6\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/0744df1a8a21643a6e95ee5e14f11ec807486209.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-x&lt;1\\]\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d41f1e7e98724e313ae061b21f25e6198b7db1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x&gt;-1\\]\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />\nFor the second case, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/1014b7700db9eb58f5543dda52308d1dd1632ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e177f73af66bb8506ba952819ab62d1fa7d4a266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5-x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> is negative.  That means (for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/1014b7700db9eb58f5543dda52308d1dd1632ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d3ff18c12a0b993cf499e0f79b0e2a2d23ce2de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x-5}{3} &lt; 2\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e60da09f03026df3ae1480cf978dca2438d3be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x-5&lt;6\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f0213520bc85306796691ce58ec09c8fa58e955c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x&lt;11\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Combine both cases to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76e80384525f9f863755e1c2d69f0eef338fe287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; x &lt; 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"12\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/367371f0c566e557659e07c2361dcfae25d0f5ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]import graph; size(10.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-4.2,xmax=14.2,ymin=-1.2,ymax=4.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=1,gy=1; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  xaxis(xmin,xmax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); yaxis(ymin,ymax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  draw((5,0)--(-4,3),EndArrow); draw((5,0)--(14,3),EndArrow); draw((-4,2)--(14,2),dotted,Arrows); draw(circle((-1,2),0.2)); draw(circle((11,2),0.2));  [/asy]\" width=\"485\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p>Another way to solve this is to graph <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb5ac9e2eea0d56cb66f2584a3cb7fdafc0b345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=|\\frac{5-x}{3}|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  The solution is the areas on the graph where the y-values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb5ac9e2eea0d56cb66f2584a3cb7fdafc0b345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=|\\frac{5-x}{3}|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> are lower than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  From the graph, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eaad3d6c671fefe944d6f02bbc818390faf6f76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;x&lt;11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"12\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 8